<title>DUBAI: Iran's 10-months steel production 4.8 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Iran's 10-months steel production 4.8 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran produced more than 4.8 million tonnes of steel in the first 10 months of the Iranian year which began on March 21, a ministry of mines and metals report said.</p>
<p>The report, quoted by Iran News daily on Sunday, showed growth of 27 percent over the same period in the previous year.</p>
<p>Officials said last year the production target for the present Iranian year was six million tonnes, up from about 4.3 million in the year ended last March.</p>
</text>
